<title>USA: State of Washington, won by Seattle First.</title>
<headline>State of Washington, won by Seattle First.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle First National Bank said it won $28 million of State of Washington, general obligation bonds, Series 1997 F, with a true interest cost of 5.334 percent.</p>
</text>
